# SFX
- To see available assets list files in the /res/sfx directory. You'll have to look in nested folders. 

To play a sound:
SFX.Play(Assets.GetAsset<AudioAsset>("INSERT PATH"), new SFX.PlaySoundDesc() { Volume = 0.7f, Position = Entity.Position, Positional=true, RangeMultiplier = 2f, Loop = false });

This returns a ulong that can be used with SFX.Stop to stop the SFX if needed. If loop is false it will stop on its own.